<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Changed</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f4f7f9;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #f39c12;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 32px;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Security Alert: Password Changed</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello,</p>
            <p>Your password for the F8 Homework account associated with this email address was successfully changed on
                <strong>
                    <%= changedAt %>
                </strong>.</p>
            <p>If you made this change, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
            <p><strong>If you did not change your password</strong>, please contact our support team immediately or
                reset your password to secure your account.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> F8 Project. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>